OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding drunk driver jailed after
OL,4,Akilling boy, 9
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disqualified drunk and drug driver
OL,7,Fwho was speeding and caused a collision
OL,8,Fwhich killed a nine-year-old boy has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FJames Connors, from Gables Close,
OL,12,FSolihull, was driving his Volkswagen
OL,13,FTiguan vehicle at 85mph in a 30mph zone
OL,14,Fon 28 July when he smashed into another
OL,15,Fcar on Primrose Hill in Kings Norton.
OL,17,FThe boy, who was in the other car, died
OL,18,Fin hospital two weeks later.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
