OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding drunk driver jailed after
OL,4,Akilling boy, 9
OL,5,
OL,6,FConnors, 32, appeared on Thursday at
OL,7,FBirmingham Crown Court, where he was
OL,8,Fjailed for 13 and a half years. He was
OL,9,Falso banned from driving for 16 years
OL,10,Fand nine months.
